<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Sets a creature's racial type. This has far reaching implications and should
<b>not</b> be called outside of <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Character%20generation" title="Character creation">character creation</a>.
</p>
